<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-NAYIM JOINS LOGRONES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NAYIM JOINS LOGRONES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Moroccan international Nayim has signed for Spanish second division club Logrones from Real Zaragoza where he has played since 1993.</p>
<p>The midfielder is best known for his spectacular lobbed goal from near the halfway line which helped Zaragoza beat Arsenal in the 1995 European Cup Winners' Cup final.</p>
